    "rich_text_8KbrYt": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "text_qhVPVK": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Segment II, featuring our Rib Knit Utility Vest & Pull on shorts in Graphite:<br/><br/>Capturing the balance between culture & community was exactly what we envisioned within this segment. Amidst the hustle and bustle of the city we found a spot for the boys to regroup - playing cards and responding to the energy of the Medina via song and dance.<br/><br/>A common theme we observed from one location to another was the connection between each of the boys - through all of our travels and differing landscapes they remained together, bonded as one.<br/><br/>For us, in showcasing our newest product from our upcoming drop - the Knit Rib Utility Vest, it was important to emphasise the cut and adaptability of it on different heights and frames. It’s soft to touch, easy to wear and pairs well with pretty much anything - from the most classic of looks in Morocco, to your go-tos in London.<br/><br/>We really wanted to challenge ourselves stylistically and have our looks reflect the silhouettes and cultural touch points of somewhere so inspirational to us in building this collection.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "text_qhVPVK"
      ],
