    "rich_text_tGbFyQ": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "text_z6yw8p": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>For our first moving image piece of the season, we take you to Morocco, somewhere dear to our team. Its warmth and rich horizons were elements that inspired the design and colour palette of our collection. As we present the introduction to a body of work that gives our collection expression and freedom, we aim to answer the questions that circulated our studio - where do we see the collection fitting?<br/><br/>As we grow and widen our collections, it's important we maintain closeness to our core mission and goal which explore themes of family and unity. Through this short film we’re transported to the sand dunes of Essaouira, a city neighbouring the more notable Marrekech, where we run, jump and carefully follow 4 friends navigating the storm of a windy desert to finally find solitude, playfulness and personality within the medina.<br/><br/>Although challenged by their environments and unpredictable forces, the boys remain held together by unbreakable bonds, strength and connection - pillars to brotherhood. They are not joined by blood but by their shared love for one another and experiences together which allow them to move forward together.<br/><br/>Throughout this project we wish to unravel the layers of our creativity and take you on a journey that shows you Morocco through our lens, pulling on differing emotive strings and giving you a sense of proximity to the cultures, places and people that inspire us.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "text_z6yw8p"
      ],
